WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.105
Today we will coordinate movement with music. Our work connects with Ghanaian and

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:06.237
other African artists.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:09.911
Choose two safe steps that suit the chosen rhythm.

00:00:11.117 --> 00:00:16.077
Connect them with a pause and a change of direction. Record why your chosen technique

00:00:16.077 --> 00:00:17.069
suits the message.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:21.385
Perform the phrase twice with control and enough personal space.
